HHIISSTTOORRYY
     Most of these functions appeared in 4.2BSD.  The rrrreessvvppoorrtt__aaff() function
     appeared in RFC2292, and was implemented by the WIDE project for the Hy‐
     drangea IPv6 protocol stack kit.  The rrccmmdd__aaff() function appeared in
     draft-ietf-ipngwg-rfc2292bis-01.txt, and was implemented in the WIDE/KAME
     IPv6 protocol stack kit.  The iirruusseerrookk__ssaa() function appeared in discus‐
     sion on the IETF ipngwg mailing list, and was implemented in FreeBSD 4.0.

